WEBVTT
Language: en

1
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:15.433
A session starts idle. Each arrow in the diagram is one row of the table named next in reducer.js, and reduceSession throws for any state and event pair without a row.

2
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:25.533
The session is idle and CONNECT arrives. The reducer finds the row idle:CONNECT and returns connecting.

3
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:35.633
The session is connecting and OPENED arrives. The reducer finds the row connecting:OPENED and returns open.

4
00:00:39.733 --> 00:00:45.733
The session is open and CLOSE arrives. The reducer finds the row open:CLOSE and returns closed.

5
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:55.567
No row starts at closed. A late OPENED finds no closed:OPENED entry, so reduceSession throws InvalidTransition, which the card shows under Returns.
